    "commit": "7c661c378",
    "summary": "Conformance against real git: FileFilter.listFiles equals git ls-files and FileFilter.includes equals git check-ignore over a fixture covering anchored, nested, negation, precedence, directory-only, globstar, exclude-file, tracked-override and forbidden re-include rules; a non-git copy leaves out the same files (ac9). It found and fixed a defect (nested no-separator patterns matched only at their own level). Real-repo check: 6,795 = 6,795 files. Full sweep vs pre-s6 baseline in S006/t12-evidence.md: all remaining failures pre-exist except CM-S5-GATE's pinned digest of src/daemon/index.ts (needs a stakeholder decision)."
  }
